 "text": "Hey, how are you? A balanced meal that hits each food group a few times day is usual. A typical day might look like morning oats or a bit of toast, a big skim milk. That's a lot of yellow from bananas and corn, but fruit and veg give the rest. Is she eating normal food, or is she on a diet? A little bit of it, but coffee on its own is a bit heavy. A little bit of yogurt or oats is easier. Letting them help with a couple of things is great. A big spoon of pureed veg doesn't keep them down if it's mixed with a little milk.",
